# Root Git Ignore for Satva Hospital Appointment Booking System

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
node_modules/

# Production Builds & Bundles
**/dist/
dist/
**/build/
build/
**/.next/
**/.output/

# Environment & Secrets (Never commit actual credentials)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# Logs & Runtime
**/logs/
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.pid
*.seed

# Database Dumps (Whitelist essential schema & seed)
*.sql
!**/schema_and_seed.sql

# OS & Editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# Uploads / Runtime files
satva/uploads/*
!satva/uploads/.gitkeep
